Import "Topology.clean.proposed"
Source topology:
  Kind: other
  Label: Topology foundations
  Title: Clean topology foundation checks

Text:
  These foundation results exercise the implemented language.
  They do not assert the five pending paper theorems.

Result inverse image intersection:
  Attribution: topology; inverse image intersection; original
  Let X,Y: Type
  Let f: Function(X,Y)
  Let S,T: Set(Y)
  Conclude:
    inverse image(f,S ∩ T) = inverse image(f,S) ∩ inverse image(f,T)

Result image membership:
  Attribution: topology; image membership; original
  Let X,Y: Type
  Let f: Function(X,Y)
  Let S: Set(X)
  Let y: Y
  Conclude:
    y ∈ image(f,S) ↔ there exists (x: X, x ∈ S and f(x) = y)

Result continuous composition:
  Attribution: topology; continuous composition; original
  Let X,Y,Z: Type
  Let t: Topology(X)
  Let u: Topology(Y)
  Let v: Topology(Z)
  Let f: Function(X,Y)
  Let g: Function(Y,Z)
  Assume continuous between(f,t,u), continuous between(g,u,v)
  Conclude: continuous between(compose maps(g,f),t,v)

Result family intersection membership:
  Attribution: topology; family intersection membership; original
  Let I,X: Type
  Let sets: Function(I,Set(X))
  Let x: X
  Conclude:
    x ∈ intersection family(sets) ↔ for every (i: I, x ∈ sets(i))

